OL,3,ACultural treasures are being destroyed
OL,4,Aby war, and people want justice
OL,5,
OL,6,FCultural treasures are being destroyed
OL,7,Fby war, and people want justice
OL,9,FAugust was a brutal month for Ukraine.
OL,10,FRussian aerial attacks increased
OL,11,Fsignificantly, launching thousands of
OL,12,Fdrones. Kyiv was intensely bombarded,
OL,13,Fas were the southern cities of Mykolaiv
OL,14,Fand Odesa. Amid the destruction and
OL,15,Floss of life, Odesa reported damage to
OL,16,Fsix Unesco-protected sites, including
OL,17,Fthe salmon-pink 19th Century Alexandru
OL,18,FSturdza House.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
