OL,3,ACultural treasures are being destroyed
OL,4,Aby war, and people want justice
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt raised again the question of why it
OL,7,Fis so hard to hold actors accountable
OL,8,Ffor the destruction of buildings and
OL,9,Fobjects with real cultural
OL,10,Fsignificance.
OL,12,FIn the last month alone, Ukraine's
OL,13,FMinistry of Culture reported that 148
OL,14,Fcultural heritage sites were recorded
OL,15,Fas damaged or destroyed, including in
OL,16,FOdesa.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
